      {
        "id": "msg_08963508758e81c1006a65326fba648198a6477851b1e13fdf",
        "content": [
          {
            "annotations": [],
            "text": "{\"episodes\":[{\"ep\":1,\"title\":\"The Dead Woman Walks In\",\"lines\":[{\"speaker\":\"COMPERE\",\"text\":\"For solving Kaveri's murder, Dharampur Police honours Inspector Devraj—\",\"sfx_cue\":\"police courtyard applause, microphone squeal\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Stop! I am Kaveri. Which murder did he solve?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"metal gate bangs open\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"Maa?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"applause cuts off, plastic chair falls\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Tara. Yes. Come here, child. You and Munni, come to me.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"hurried footsteps on stone\"},{\"speaker\":\"omkar\",\"text\":\"Girls, stay where you are.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"wooden staff strikes stone once\"},{\"speaker\":\"munni\",\"text\":\"Didi... she knows my name.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"Lots of people know our names.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Look at me, Tara. Look properly. That scar beside your ear, you got it falling from my cot.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"Don't... don't say things like that.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Constable, close the gate. Nobody leaves the courtyard.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"police whistle, gate scrapes shut\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Devraj, tell them. You came to our house twice. You drank tea from the blue steel cup.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"crowd murmurs rising\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Let us be precise. You know my name because it was announced on the microphone.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"No. I know your face. I know my father. I know my daughters.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"Do not call me that.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"walking stick taps forward\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Baba...\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"My daughter is dead.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"WOMAN IN CROWD\",\"text\":\"Shameless woman. Today of all days, she came to claim a dead mother's children.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"crowd murmurs agreement\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"I am not claiming them. I gave birth to them.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"omkar\",\"text\":\"Inspector, remove this disturbance. The district officers are waiting to present your medal.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"medal case snaps shut\"},{\"speaker\":\"farida\",\"text\":\"No, let her speak. You gave medals before giving four innocent men a trial.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"bangles clink as someone pushes through chairs\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Farida, this ceremony is not about your brother.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"farida\",\"text\":\"You arrested Rafiq for killing Kaveri. Kaveri has just walked through your gate.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"crowd erupts\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Rafiq? The mechanic? What did you do to him?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"farida\",\"text\":\"Eighteen months in jail. Rafiq, Mahesh, Bansi and Irfan. Your murder made Inspector Devraj famous.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"My murder... no. No, I was gone, but I wasn't—\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Enough. A solved case does not collapse because a stranger memorised village gossip.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"police baton knocks railing\"},{\"speaker\":\"meera\",\"text\":\"Sir, identity verification should be recorded before—\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Meera, you are here to manage certificates, not investigations.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"meera\",\"text\":\"Yes, sir.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"papers gathered quickly\"},{\"speaker\":\"NARRATOR\",\"text\":\"Before the first clap that morning, one page had already been cut from the corpse register. Nobody in that courtyard saw who took it.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"loose paper flutters beneath wooden dais\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Take my fingerprints. Ask me anything. Tara was born just before dawn. Munni hates milk skin. Baba keeps mother's anklet inside the grain tin.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"Quiet.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"You know that is true.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"A thief can learn where a family keeps its jewellery.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"munni\",\"text\":\"Nana, she sounds like Maa.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"omkar\",\"text\":\"Munni, your mother received proper final rites. Do not insult her memory by staring at this woman.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"You brought my children to watch a man receive a prize for my death?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"They said you screamed. They said those men killed you near the canal.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Tara, I did not die near any canal.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"Then where were you?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"I... I will tell you. Just come here first.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"No. Answer me first.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"She will answer inside, after we establish who she is. Children should not hear an impostor's inventions.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Do not call me an impostor in front of my daughters.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Then provide a valid identity document.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"It was taken. My residency card, my electoral slip, everything. Check your old records.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"meera\",\"text\":\"Sir, the old electoral register may have her photograph.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"The register records a deceased voter. It cannot testify for a living stranger.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"farida\",\"text\":\"But a burnt body testified well enough to jail four men?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"scattered claps from crowd\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Farida, your courage is impressive. Your brother's workshop lease is still under police review, isn't it.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"farida\",\"text\":\"You already took the workshop. You cannot frighten us with its empty walls.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Inspector, I came for my children. Move aside.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"bare feet step forward\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"You came into a police station, interrupted an official ceremony and attempted to approach two minors. You will wait where complainants wait.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"metal railing gate unlatches\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"I am their mother.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"That is your complaint. Stand behind the railing while we examine it.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"CONSTABLE\",\"text\":\"Inside, madam.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"metal railing gate rattles\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Don't touch me. Tara, Munni, I am here. I came back for you.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"cloth scuffle, railing gate slams\"},{\"speaker\":\"MUNNI\",\"text\":\"Maa!\",\"sfx_cue\":\"child runs two steps\"},{\"speaker\":\"omkar\",\"text\":\"Hold her, Tara.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"tara\",\"text\":\"Munni, stop. Please... just stop.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Baba, tell them about the burn on my left wrist. Tell them how I got it in your kitchen.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"Many women have burns.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Tell them what you called me when I was small.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"My child is not standing behind that railing.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Then look into my face and say whose body you buried.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"We did not bury anyone.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"walking stick stops\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"What?\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"devraj\",\"text\":\"Harilal, there is no need to discuss evidence publicly.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"There is every need. This woman wants the village to doubt my daughter's death.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"canvas satchel opens\"},{\"speaker\":\"kaveri\",\"text\":\"Baba, please. I am standing here.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"\"},{\"speaker\":\"harilal\",\"text\":\"This is Kaveri's death certificate. I identified the body. I personally lit my daughter's funeral pyre.\",\"sfx_cue\":\"official paper unfolds beside microphone\"}]}],\"beat_sheet\":[{\"beat_id\":\"b001\",\"ep\":1,\"seq\":1,\"world_time\":\"2024-08-15\",\"location\":\"Dharampur police station records area\",\"present\":[],\"witnessed_by\":[],\"hidden_from\":[\"kaveri\",\"devraj\",\"harilal\",\"tara\",\"munni\",\"rafiq\",\"mahesh\",\"bansi\",\"irfan\",\"farida\",\"jagat\",\"meera\",\"naina\",\"sudha\",\"leela\",\"omkar\"],\"what_happened\":\"An unknown person has cut one page from the corpse register before the ceremony.\",\"state_changes\":[{\"entity\":\"corpse register\",\"fact\":\"One page is missing before Kaveri's return becomes public.\",\"valence\":-3}],\"source_ref\":\"fictionalized\",\"tier\":\"core_canon\",\"note\":\"Deliberate open canon: no cast character witnessed the page's removal or knows who removed it.\"},{\"beat_id\":\"b002\",\"ep\":1,\"seq\":2,\"world_time\":\"2024-08-15\",\"location\":\"Dharampur police station courtyard\",\"present\":[\"devraj\",\"harilal\",\"tara\",\"munni\",\"farida\",\"meera\",\"omkar\"],\"witnessed_by\":[],\"hidden_from\":[\"rafiq\",\"mahesh\",\"bansi\",\"irfan\"],\"what_happened\":\"A public police ceremony honours Devraj for solving Kaveri's supposed murder and jailing four accused men.\",\"state_changes\":[{\"entity\":\"devraj\",\"fact\":\"His reputation and anticipated promotion are publicly tied to the solved murder case.\",\"valence\":3},{\"entity\":\"rafiq\",\"fact\":\"His imprisonment is publicly presented as part of a solved murder case.\",\"valence\":-3}],\"source_ref\":\"fictionalized\",\"tier\":\"core_canon\",\"note\":null},{\"beat_id\":\"b003\",\"ep\":1,\"seq\":3,\"world_time\":\"2024-08-15\",\"location\":\"Dharampur police station courtyard\",\"present\":[\"kaveri\",\"devraj\",\"harilal\",\"tara\",\"munni\",\"farida\",\"meera\",\"omkar\"],\"witnessed_by\":[],\"hidden_from\":[\"rafiq\",\"mahesh\",\"bansi\",\"irfan\",\"jagat\",\"naina\",\"sudha\"],\"what_happened\":\"Kaveri enters the ceremony alive, identifies her family and demands access to her daughters.\",\"state_changes\":[{\"entity\":\"kaveri\",\"fact\":\"Her survival becomes public in Dharampur police station.\",\"valence\":4},{\"entity\":\"tara\",\"fact\":\"She encounters a living woman who knows intimate details and claims to be her mother.\",\"valence\":-2},{\"entity\":\"munni\",\"fact\":\"She hears Kaveri identify herself as her mother.\",\"valence\":2},{\"entity\":\"devraj\",\"fact\":\"The central premise of his celebrated murder case is publicly challenged.\",\"valence\":-5}],\"source_ref\":\"fictionalized\",\"tier\":\"core_canon\",\"note\":null},{\"beat_id\":\"b004\",\"ep\":1,\"seq\":4,\"world_time\":\"2024-08-15\",\"location\":\"Dharampur police station complainants' railing\",\"present\":[\"kaveri\",\"devraj\",\"harilal\",\"tara\",\"munni\",\"farida\",\"meera\",\"omkar\"],\"witnessed_by\":[],\"hidden_from\":[\"rafiq\",\"mahesh\",\"bansi\",\"irfan\",\"jagat\",\"naina\",\"sudha\"],\"what_happened\":\"Devraj publicly labels Kaveri an unverified impostor and has her confined behind the complainants' railing.\",\"state_changes\":[{\"entity\":\"kaveri\",\"fact\":\"Police classify her claim to her own identity as a complaint requiring verification.\",\"valence\":-4},{\"entity\":\"devraj\",\"fact\":\"He preserves official control of the ceremony by treating Kaveri as an impostor.\",\"valence\":2},{\"entity\":\"farida\",\"fact\":\"She publicly connects Kaveri's return to the imprisonment of the four accused men.\",\"valence\":3}],\"source_ref\":\"fictionalized\",\"tier\":\"core_canon\",\"note\":null},{\"beat_id\":\"b005\",\"ep\":1,\"seq\":5,\"world_time\":\"2024-08-15\",\"location\":\"Dharampur police station complainants' railing\",\"present\":[\"kaveri\",\"devraj\",\"harilal\",\"tara\",\"munni\",\"farida\",\"meera\",\"omkar\"],\"witnessed_by\":[],\"hidden_from\":[\"rafiq\",\"mahesh\",\"bansi\",\"irfan\",\"jagat\",\"naina\",\"sudha\"],\"what_happened\":\"Harilal produces Kaveri's death certificate and states that he identified the body and personally lit the funeral pyre.\",\"state_changes\":[{\"entity\":\"harilal\",\"fact\":\"He publicly rejects the living Kaveri by relying on his identification of the cremated body.\",\"valence\":-4},{\"entity\":\"kaveri\",\"fact\":\"Her legal death and her father's cremation testimony become immediate barriers to reclaiming her identity.\",\"valence\":-5},{\"entity\":\"death certificate\",\"fact\":\"It is publicly presented as proof that Kaveri is dead.\",\"valence\":-4}],\"source_ref\":\"fictionalized\",\"tier\":\"core_canon\",\"note\":null}],\"promise_ledger\":[{\"id\":\"p001\",\"raised_ep\":1,\"listener_is_waiting_for\":\"Who removed the page from the corpse register, and what evidence did it contain?\",\"must_pay_by_ep\":7,\"paid_ep\":null,\"how_paid\":null,\"status\":\"open\"},{\"id\":\"p002\",\"raised_ep\":1,\"listener_is_waiting_for\":\"Will Kaveri prove her identity despite her death certificate and regain access to her daughters?\",\"must_pay_by_ep\":7,\"paid_ep\":null,\"how_paid\":null,\"status\":\"open\"},{\"id\":\"p003\",\"raised_ep\":1,\"listener_is_waiting_for\":\"Whose body did Harilal identify and cremate as Kaveri?\",\"must_pay_by_ep\":7,\"paid_ep\":null,\"how_paid\":null,\"status\":\"open\"},{\"id\":\"p004\",\"raised_ep\":1,\"listener_is_waiting_for\":\"What will Kaveri's return do to the murder case against Rafiq, Mahesh, Bansi and Irfan?\",\"must_pay_by_ep\":7,\"paid_ep\":null,\"how_paid\